# Digilist Platform - Windsurf AI Rules
# Contract-First Architecture Enforcement

# =============================================================================
# CRITICAL RULES - NEVER VIOLATE  
# =============================================================================

## 1. ZERO TRANSFORMERS
- Never create toXxx(), fromXxx(), mapXxx(), adaptXxx() functions in apps/
- Never create *VM, *ViewModel, *UiModel types
- Never reshape API DTOs before rendering
- Never compute permissions/actions in frontend
- Always use Projection DTOs directly from SDK

## 2. SDK-FIRST
- Never use fetch() or axios directly in apps/
- All network calls via @digilist/client-sdk only
- If SDK lacks a method, report gap - do NOT bypass

## 3. TERMINOLOGY
- Always use "listing" (never facility, venue, space)

## 4. DESIGNSYSTEMET
- Never import @digdir/* directly in apps/
- Only import from @xala/ds

## 5. RFC7807
- All errors must be ProblemDetails compliant

# =============================================================================
# CODE PATTERNS
# =============================================================================

## Correct Component Pattern
```tsx
function ListingCard({ listing }: { listing: ListingCardProjectionDTO }) {
  return (
    <Card>
      <h2>{listing.title}</h2>
      {listing.permissions.canBook && <BookButton />}
    </Card>
  );
}
```

## Correct Hook Pattern  
```typescript
export function useListingDetails(id: string) {
  return useQuery({
    queryKey: queryKeys.listing.details(id),
    queryFn: () => sdk.listing.getById(id),
  });
}
```

## Forbidden Patterns
```typescript
// ❌ NEVER
function toCardModel(listing) { return {...} }
useQuery({ select: (data) => transformData(data) })
if (user.role === 'admin') { canEdit = true }
```

